14","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9f6a9c03b0099ee0860b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n73135-1-21-2","ko":"음, 양념이 음식에 고루 잘 밴 것이 매우 맛있구나.","zh":"嗯，调味料均匀地渗透在食物里，真是非常美味呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음,","meaning":"嗯","explanation":"음：嗯。","readings":[{"term":"음","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71111","senseId":"1","lemma":"음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3"}},{"text":"양념이","meaning":"调料，调味料，佐料","explanation":"양념：调料，调味料，佐料；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"양념","audio":"/audio/c6ed85ec7cb4625c51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73135","senseId":"1","lemma":"양념","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"양념이","audio":"/audio/141d91c31f3da0a129b7.mp3"}},{"text":"음식에","meaning":"食物，食品","explanation":"음식：食物，食品；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"2","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식에","audio":"/audio/ed1a36c3f9ac6e3f777e.mp3"}},{"text":"고루","meaning":"平均，均匀","explanation":"고루：平均，均匀。","readings":[{"term":"고루","audio":"/audio/d47945b5b1b8518c78a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19930","senseId":"1","lemma":"고루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고루","audio":"/audio/d47945b5b1b8518c78a4.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"밴","meaning":"浸，浸透","explanation":"배다：浸，浸透；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"t